Extraction changes:
- Standalone Android library and native-Views demo, independent of wedo UI/Room.
- Only the evidence-backed top-level kbList JSON protocol is exposed.
- Explicit week sets, strict bounds and anonymous per-record errors.
- No fallback from missing/unknown week strings to weeks 1..16.
- No native JS interface: same-origin fetch and guarded evaluateJavascript polling.
- Missing kbList is an error, not an empty semester.
- App-wide CookieManager clearing is explicit and never clears saved courses.

